{"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","symbolKind":"struct","title":"Tracker","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L51","fileName":"Tracker.swift"},"role":"symbol"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/Records-swift.struct"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/enriched(by:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties","title":"Type Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker is a value. Build one where the app starts, start delivering its records, and either"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pass the tracker down or bind it to a task with "},{"code":"withTracker","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and read it anywhere inside with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: ConsoleDestination())","withTracker(tracker) {","    Tracker.current.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","}","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Copies share one stream of records. A binding reaches the work run inside ","type":"text"},{"code":"withTracker","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the child tasks it starts, but not callbacks a framework runs on tasks of its own, such as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"UI framework’s button actions: pass those a tracker.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" does nothing but accept the event, from any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"thread: it reads the clock, captures the call site and the task’s "},{"code":"ServiceContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and queues"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them. A worker the tracker owns, which never runs on the main actor, does everything else, in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the order events were tracked: the constraints’ check, the enrichers, the samplers, the consent,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a store’s writes, and publishing to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". No API runs that work on a caller’s thread. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" waits for the worker to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"catch up; "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" does too, then ends the records."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Tracked events wait in memory, without a bound, until the worker reaches them. The queue","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can’t be bounded without losing something it mustn’t: it also carries consent decisions and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the waits of ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","isActive":true},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"track"},{"text":" can’t wait for room without blocking its caller.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Without a store, records live in memory only, and records not yet delivered are lost if the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"process exits. A tracker given a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RecordStore"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"},{"text":")","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivers what the store kept from earlier runs first, and writes each record to it once the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"worker reaches it: a record is durable from then on, and one tracked moments before the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"process is killed, not yet reached, is lost.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker given "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s keeps a seeded fraction of the events they apply to, dropping the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rest before they are held, written or delivered and reporting them on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker given a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","type":"reference"},{"text":" delivers an event only once its category is granted, holding it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while undecided and dropping it when denied; one given none delivers every event.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/records-swift.property":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The records of the events this tracker tracks, for a delivery to read."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Records","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV7RecordsV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"records","role":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/flush()":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"flush()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"flush","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/flush()","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Waits until the tracker’s worker has handled every event tracked, and every consent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"decision made, before the call: each record is written to the store, if any, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"published to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", or held or dropped by the consent."}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/noOp":{"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"noOp","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","text":"Tracker","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"noOp","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker that drops every event, logging each one at debug level. Its "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":" are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"empty."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/noop"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/enriched(by:)":{"title":"enriched(by:)","abstract":[{"text":"A copy of this tracker whose events’ contexts ","type":"text"},{"code":"enricher","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" also changes, for the code it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"handed to.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/enriched(by:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/enriched(by:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enriched","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/init(consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)":{"title":"init(consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"init","